
A package to remove X support from TeX so that you don't need the X
shared libraries.  Obviously, you don't want to install this if you _do_
use X. :^)

mf-nox11: mf-nox11 
mf-nox11:
mf-nox11: This package contains the binaries for MetaFont, the bases mf.base
mf-nox11: (plain.base) and cmmf.base (cmplain.base) and the basic setup for the
mf-nox11: font directories. The current version of MetaFont is 2.71 (C version
mf-nox11: 6.1).
mf-nox11:
mf-nox11: This is a special version of the MetaFont package that was compiled
mf-nox11: to _not_ use any X shared libraries.  Obviously, you won't want to
mf-nox11: install this on machines that do run X.
